            "action_description": {
              "value": "(acid)\n\nThe giant aukashungi releases an acidic gas from its ventral glands in a 30-foot burst. Each creature that starts its turn in the area takes 10d8 acid damage plus 2d8 persistent acid damage (32 basic Fortitude save). The gas moves 10 feet away from the giant aukashungi each round and lasts for 1 minute.\n\nThe giant aukashungi can't use Acidic Effluence again for 1 minute."
